## Running the Application

### 1. Set Up Environment Variables

Copy the `.env.example` template:
```bash
cp .env.example .env
```
And adjust settings (especially `DATABASE_URL` and `JWT_SECRET_KEY`).

### 2. Install Dependencies

Ensure you have a virtual environment active, then run:
```bash
pip install -e .
```

### 3. Migrations {% if db_type == "mongodb" %}(Not applicable for MongoDB){% else %}(SQLAlchemy projects only){% endif %}

```bash
devflow migrate init
devflow migrate make "initial schema"
devflow migrate run
```

### 4. Run the Development Server

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload
```
The interactive API documentation will be available at: http://localhost:8000/docs
